OL,3,GNEWSACrane set to lift collapsed bridge
OL,4,Aout of harbour                         
OL,6,FOver the next few days, a crane on a   
OL,7,Fbarge will "carefully lift the three   
OL,8,Fspans of Pero's Bridge and transport   
OL,9,Fthem to dry dock for a detailed        
OL,10,Finspection", a council spokesperson    
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
